//    RSQGO_Deaths.Lookup): RSQGO_D_<launcher> runs that launcher's recipe, RSQGO_W_<wall missile> traces
//    that missile's flight. Each keeps BD's Speed (A_CustomMissile sets a spawned missile's velocity from the
//    SPAWNED class's Speed: p_actionfunctions.cpp A_SpawnProjectile) and BD's Radius (the advance of every
//    missile it spawns: P_CheckMissileSpawn(missile, shooter radius)).
// 2. RSQGO_Deaths.BuildCards(): every wall card, every recipe and its entries in BD's state order. An entry's
//    arguments are written as BD wrote them: a number, r<lo>:<hi> for random(lo, hi), f<lo>:<hi> for frandom.
//    Routes, modes and groups: deaths.zs (DR_*, DM_*, DG_*).

